  "description": "In the future, the convicts of Earth are exiled into space to preserve natural resources. The abandoned spaceship-turned-prison “Cosmic” has already expanded to their seventh habitat. Minkyu, Dustin and Huiming are Cosmic Seven's newest boarders. Minkyu, the crook who impersonated a doctor, looks for comfort in the kind guard Leo, while simultaneously feeling sympathy for the cannibal-murderer Niger...\n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
